</div>
<a class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-navy-deep border border-cyber-blue/40 hover:bg-precision-teal hover:text-navy-deep text-cyber-blue flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shadow-sm" href="tel:+917904355971" aria-label="Call Mr. R. Natarajan">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">call</span>
